   - [x] Isolate inline code-block preview scripts from the app origin.
   - [ ] Give multi-file project previews an isolated origin with reliable assets.
   - [ ] Preserve code, tool output, and errors throughout retries and reconnects.
6. Equal-context performance work
   - [x] Avoid needless media reloads/cleanup; enable inference mode.
   - [ ] Profile attention, batching, prompt caching, allocation and transfer costs.
   - [ ] Benchmark before/after at identical context/output settings (deferred).
7. Media Studio, Model Hub, and navigation
   - [x] Image / Video / Music / Voice workspace, ready models and useful reasons.
   - [x] Task controls, Stop, persistent errors, saved gallery, download/delete.
   - [x] Responsive desktop/mobile Media layouts and keyboard controls.
   - [x] Discover / My Models / Downloads hierarchy; quieter filters and cards.
   - [x] Fix Hub startup initialization and stale search response races.
   - [x] Simplify sidebar without changing the main chat layout.
